      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Protected sponsor identity with scoped lifecycle approval.\nDelegation: Transaction data owner defines ten-person cohort and purpose.\nRevoke — Deal-room access owner: Expire/remove assignment, disable orphaned guest and request app-side session denial.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed objective after removal/expiry. Exported documents and independent workload access require separate handling.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Protected sponsor identity with scoped lifecycle approval.\nDelegation: Transaction data owner defines ten-person cohort and purpose.\nRevoke — Deal-room access owner: Expire/remove assignment, disable orphaned guest and request app-side session denial.\nTiming/residual: 30-minute proposed objective after removal/expiry. Exported documents and independent workload access require separate handling.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false
    },
