      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential: Transition-specific workload federation binding with exact issuer/subject/audience.\nDelegation: Transition release owner grants scoped deployment permission.\nRevoke — Transition release owner: Remove federation binding and resource permission, cancel deployments and inspect previously deployed code.\nTiming/residual: 15-minute proposed objective. Disabling credential does not undo previously deployed privileged code.",
      "originalText": "Credential: Transition-specific workload federation binding with exact issuer/subject/audience.\nDelegation: Transition release owner grants scoped deployment permission.\nRevoke — Transition release owner: Remove federation binding and resource permission, cancel deployments and inspect previously deployed code.\nTiming/residual: 15-minute proposed objective. Disabling credential does not undo previously deployed privileged code.",
      "fontSize": 12,
