      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Forbidden authority paths:\nOrbit home/guest → Cedar production administration\nOrbit guest → transition tenant role, consent or trust administration\nSponsor → unrestricted user provisioning or tenant role grants\nTransition workload → recreate removed trust/guest assignments\nEmergency separation → source-home-IdP approval dependency",
